zing Guidelines for more information.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2023-11-07\nValid as Of: 2023-11-07\nVersion: 2309\n\n--- Record 3929 ---\nComponent: Edge Integration Cell\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: nan\nDescription: You can now develop custom sender adapters that are supported to be used on an Edge Integration Cell runtime.  See: Additional Metadata to Support Edge Integration Cell\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2023-11-07\nValid as Of: 2023-11-07\nVersion: 2309\n\n--- Record 3930 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Telemetry module: Update to version 1.2.0\nDescription: The new version brings the following improvements:  Logs:      Update to Fluent Bit 2.1.10 (#463)      Traces:      New: Manual scaling of the trace gateway (#430).      Improved system span filtering to reduce span noise caused by Kyma component communication (#468)       Update to OTel Collector 0.87.0 (#463)       Removed Logging Exporter from trace gateway configuration, so that the logs of the gateway are", ".2.0\nDescription: The new version brings the following improvements:  Logs:      Update to Fluent Bit 2.1.10 (#463)      Traces:      New: Manual scaling of the trace gateway (#430).      Improved system span filtering to reduce span noise caused by Kyma component communication (#468)       Update to OTel Collector 0.87.0 (#463)       Removed Logging Exporter from trace gateway configuration, so that the logs of the gateway are no longer polluted and warnings and errors are easier to detect (#440).    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2023-10-23\nValid as Of: 2023-11-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n", "--- Record 751 ---\nComponent: Job Scheduling Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: Deletion of One-Time Schedules Not Run Within Last 30 Days\nDescription: As of May 29, 2025, one-time schedules will be deleted if they have not been run within the last 30 days.  Action: Instead of using one-time schedules, you can run recurring schedules. See Recurring Schedules.\nAction: Recommended\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-15\nValid as Of: 2025-05-29\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 752 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Improved Accessibility\nDescription: Added color independent visual markers to signal periods with low availability.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-29\nValid as Of: 2025-05-29\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 753 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Improved API Documentation\nDescription: Improved the AvS API documentation of the evaluation-metadata and the evaluation-data APIs in the interactive Swagger documentation. Upgraded to the OpenAPI 3.1.0 standard.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-29\nValid as Of: 2025-05-29\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 754 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Improved the Alert Incident History Visualisation\nDescription: You can now see the alert incidents as part of your event history in a unified and standardised way.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-29\nValid as Of: 2025-05-29\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 755 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Improved the Email Performance\nDescription: Improved the throughput of AvS email alerting solution.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Tec